== page headers (nginx)
Server: nginx
Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' https://www.google.com/recaptcha/ https://www.gstatic.com/recaptcha/; frame-src https://www.google.com/recaptcha/ https://recaptcha.google.com/recaptcha/; connect-src 'self'; img-src 'self' data:; style-src 'self'; frame-ancestors 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'
X-Frame-Options: DENY
X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
Referrer-Policy: no-referrer
== API headers through nginx
X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
X-Frame-Options: DENY
Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'none'; frame-ancestors 'none'
Referrer-Policy: no-referrer
== container users
backend: app
frontend: nginx
